Discover this magnificent brand-new three-bedroom apartment, thoughtfully designed to provide a modern and comfortable lifestyle. Featuring high-quality finishes and premium equipment, this property stands out for its functional layout and meticulous attention to detail.

Key features include:

- 3 en-suite bedrooms;

- Open-plan living and dining area;

- Balconies in every room;

- Air conditioning in the living room and bedrooms;

- Private garage.

A unique opportunity for those seeking a modern family apartment with superior-quality finishes.

Other three-bedroom units are also available in the same development (K), (N), and (F).

Contact us for more information, availability, or to schedule a viewing. 

